  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into thick half-moons. Cut tomato into wedges. Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Place carrot, zucchini, tomato, garlic & herb spice blend, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper on the lined oven tray. Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices (you should get 3 pieces per person).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c076aaab04ab650e1a6/step-ad7b0600.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter over medium-high heat.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add the water and a pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c076aaab04ab650e1a6/step-6edae510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While couscous is cooking, heat a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Remove from heat, add the honey and a splash of water and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c076aaab04ab650e1a6/step-891b5c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add roast veggies and a squeeze of lemon juice to couscous. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide couscous between plates. Top with haloumi and garlic aioli. Serve with remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69784c076aaab04ab650e1a6/step-87a3cd30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
